---
description: Project overview and non-negotiable rules for Money Tracking Dashboard
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before making changes. Key rules:

- Vite + React SPA in `frontend/`, Django 6 API in `backend/` (single app `finance`), JSON under `/api/*`.
- Postgres is the read SoT; Google Sheets is written first, then dual-write to Postgres. Dual-write failure after sheet success must not return success.
- Per-user isolation via signed-in user and `sheet_id`.
- Google OAuth + signed session cookies; CSRF on mutating SPA requests (`X-CSRFToken`).
- Secrets (`GOOGLE_*`, `GROQ_*`) server-only; sync new env vars with `.env.example` and `setup-env.ps1`.
- Same-origin `/api` (Vite proxy locally, Vercel Services in production).
- Finish by running `python manage.py test finance` and/or `npm test` + `npm run build` for the side you changed.
